          "description": "Retrieves metadata about a specified FHIR resource type, including its supported search parameters and custom operations. This tool MUST always be invoked before performing any resource operation (such as search, read, create, update, or delete) to discover the valid searchParams and operations permitted for that resource type. Do not use this tool to fetch actual resources.",
