          "name": "update",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:635ae281e1fcdc51320383dbb0c6a1315c388cdea8f7cfa11f1da9d4be1c3f16",
          "description": "Performs a FHIR `update` interaction by replacing an existing resource instance's content with the provided payload. Use it when you need to overwrite a resource's data in its entirety, such as correcting or completing a record, and you already know the resource's logical id. Optionally, you can include searchParam for conditional updates (e.g., only update if the resource matches certain criteria) or specify a custom operation (e.g., `$validate` to run validation before updating) The tool returns the updated resource or an OperationOutcome detailing any errors.",
